    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Quillsen are delighted to present 165 Crosbies Yard to the market, a spacious and well-presented ground floor duplex apartment boasting a fabulous west-facing terrace.\n\nThe bright and airy accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall with excellent storage and guest WC, a generous open-plan living/dining area with a separate kitchen, and sliding patio doors opening directly onto the private terrace. \n\nAt first-floor level, there is a large double bedroom with ample built-in wardrobes, a lobby area with immersion and plumbing for a washer/dryer, together with a well-appointed bathroom.\n\nThe property is presented in excellent condition throughout and would make an ideal home for an owner-occupier or an attractive investment opportunity.\n\nCrosbies Yard is conveniently located just off Ossory Road, within easy walking distance of Dublin City Centre, the IFSC, Docklands and East Wall Business Park. The location offers excellent access to a wide range of amenities, transport links, shops, restaurants and employment hubs.\n\nFeatures include:\n\n\nSpacious ground floor duplex apartment\n\nFabulous North- Westerly facing private terrace\n\nBright and airy accommodation\n\nLarge double bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n\nOpen-plan living/dining area with kitchen off\n\nGuest WC\n\nExcellent storage\n\n\nPresented in excellent condition\nIdeal for owner-occupiers or investors\n\nConvenient location close to City Centre, IFSC and Docklands\n\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1m (3'3\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\nWith feature laminate flooring.\n\nGuest WC - 1.5m (4'11\") x 1.5m (4'11\")\nWith wash hand basin, concealed wc with tiled splash back and ceramic tiled floor. Feature fitted wall mirror.\n\nSitting / Dining Room - 4m (13'1\") x 5m (16'5\")\nBright and airy living space with feature vaulted ceiling with floor to ceiling, wall to wall windows, with sliding\n\nKitchen - 1.8m (5'11\") x 2.4m (7'10\")\nQuality Shaker style wall and floor press units with integrated fridge/freezer and dishwasher with built oven and hob. Fitted extractor fan with stainless steel splash back. Attractive Granite worktop surface with granite splash back and feature under counter lighting.\n\nBedroom - 4.5m (14'9\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\nLarge and airy double bedroom with floor to ceiling wardrobes, Feature laminate flooring.\n\nRear Lobby\nL Shaped with laminate flooring. Large built in storage press with immersion and plumbed for washing machine\n\nBathroom - 2.3m (7'7\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\nComprising of bath with shower fitting, concealed WC and vanity wash hand basin. Granite worktop and feature wall mirror. Part tiled walls and ceramic tiled floor.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
